OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of girl murdered by ex
OL,4,Agiven law change hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a murdered schoolgirl
OL,7,Fsays the government has told them it
OL,8,Fplans to create a new law defining
OL,9,Fteenage abusive relationships because
OL,10,Fof their campaigning.
OL,12,FMicala and Lee Trussler met the
OL,13,FSafeguarding and Violence Against Women
OL,14,Fand Girls minister Satvir Kaur at the
OL,15,FHome Office in London on Monday, where
OL,16,Fthey were given an outline of the
OL,17,Fplans.
OL,19,FTheir daughter, Holly Newton, was 15
OL,20,Fwhen she was stabbed to death in an
OL,21,Falleyway in Hexham in January 2023 by
OL,22,Fher ex-boyfriend Logan MacPhail.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
